{"sections":[{"slug":"Moore复形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Moore复形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Moore <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Moore 复形”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">给定单纯群</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> Moore <span lang=\"zh\">复形是如下定义的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">可能非</span> Abel) <span lang=\"zh\">群复形</span> $(NG_\\bullet,\\partial)$.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$NG_n =\\bigcap_{i=1}^n\\ker d^n_i$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">中第</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">面均消失的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">单形的集合</span>;</li>\n<li>$\\partial\\colon NG_n \\to NG_{n-1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为仅剩的面映射</span> $d_0^n$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$NG_1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素是基点在</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的线段</span>;</li>\n<li>$NG_1$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的圈是基点在</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的圆圈</span>;</li>\n<li>$NG_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素是基点在</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维圆盘</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其整个边界是一个</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">单形的第</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>;</li>\n<li>$NG_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的圈是基点在</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维球面</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于单纯</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> Moore <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span> $NA$ <span lang=\"zh\">为连合的</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群链复形</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">我们描述单形</span> $\\Delta^k$ <span lang=\"zh\">自由生成的单纯</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $\\mathbb{Z}[\\Delta^k]$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Moore <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span> $N\\mathbb{Z}[\\Delta^n]$.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$N\\mathbb{Z}[\\Delta^k]_n$</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Dold–Kan对应","text":"Dold–Kan <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Moore+complex</p>\n"}]}}}]}